{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "7d3e3aca3a225cb2bc07dbf583679733283b1d7ea0a9193d085c8c243de37433", "ja": "にぎやかなパーティーと空いた席", "zh": "热闹的派对与空出的座位", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c5e2d52146d0519bb4330fa95f6a7fd74dacec15feeb3476d925bcb8f9ece8d6", "ja": "子ども達とのクリスマスパーティーが\n盛り上がる中、瑞希は元気のない女の子に\n気付く。どうやら今日来るはずだった友達が\n入院したらしい。それを聞いた真はあること\nを思いつき、プロデューサーに相談する。", "zh": "在和孩子们举办的圣诞派对正热闹时，\n瑞希注意到有个女孩子显得没什么精神。\n似乎是她原本今天打算一起来的朋友住院了。\n得知这件事的真想到了一个主意，\n便找制作人商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a267877abb7987ac2de367bad1ba08cc9b016ff0c9f700728737700a1c865528", "ja": "（合唱団の子ども達とのクリスマスパーティーが\n始まった。皆、この前よりリラックスしてるみたいだ）", "zh": "（和合唱团的孩子们一起举办的圣诞派对开始了。大家好像都比上次放松了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "409b188635ade60868e7619da2f9e5d1055dcd3c90132a667f22a162c33c06a4", "ja": "みなさん、チキンが焼けましたわ！　お代わりも\nありますから、たくさん食べてくださいまし！", "zh": "各位，烤鸡烤好啦！还可以再添，\n请大家多吃一点哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1002_onnanoko1", "source_sha256": "34191177af9216f47c4d9eab4d1416cd2049ae85b4d6a76438f5a201b78871dd", "ja": "わー、おいしそー♪", "zh": "哇，看起来好好吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1003_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "3489a5bac81807a3036382b0c9b4e13168e93507b854f3b73be0e1391f239deb", "ja": "やったー！　いただきまーす！", "zh": "太好了！那我开动啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "68095ca37fa2825bd64513ba2c3a848463a4e69e66d754da0e8b002a2f7d1d08", "ja": "それでは……イッツ・ショウターイム。", "zh": "那么……表演时间到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "dbf6714e1426e2e1b252fddbed32945f209ba2f2b246a13580c1051ee942c58c", "ja": "今からこのカードを、あちらにいる\n{$P$}の胸ポケットに……えいっ。", "zh": "现在就把这张卡片放进那边\n{$P$}的胸前口袋……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1006_otokonoko2", "source_sha256": "8155d80f16f5e7b0e33766348f167dd8a726552563adfebf55c7236de584caf4", "ja": "えっ……！\n瑞希お姉ちゃんの手から、カードが消えた！？", "zh": "咦……！\n瑞希姐姐手里的卡牌消失了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1007_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "4a4e7f1af8fe068d6cd41023f908ef4c233736f092afd2875e0fa4f2d03472c8", "ja": "ほんとにポケットにあるの！？　見せて見せて！", "zh": "真的在口袋里吗！？让我看看，让我看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d54efef5c4ac206edc29a55ac8c53e6926c7f7fa3dd15d82238c5133345b922", "ja": "いやいや、まさかそんな……\nええっ！？　ほ、本当にあった……。", "zh": "不不，怎么可能……\n诶诶！？真、真的有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1009_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "29223298af63d5532e5ff38a66e70636acb37e2d510bdd80d085886c365b081b", "ja": "すごーい！！", "zh": "好厉害！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "23695c83fb32a1513b3a95eaf52ce3f9a7dd18e2d3db6c331d3f5b61c5f142b9", "ja": "ふっふっふ。これで終わりではありません。\nまだまだいくぞ。……ぶい。", "zh": "呵呵呵。这样还没有结束。\n接下来还要继续哦。……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "9779c70d70e21ea3ada32c0999a849e6106606a2b6fcf2bf501467427056313b", "ja": "こうやってターンして……イェーイ♪\nほらほら、みんなも踊ってみて！", "zh": "像这样转个圈……耶♪  \n来嘛来嘛，大家也一起跳跳看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1012_onnanoko3", "source_sha256": "3bcbc0eef21ba4c2ad0c959f4f881f42ed09bb41c6420781c2abf97c69c1d397", "ja": "エレナお姉ちゃん、かわいい～♪", "zh": "艾莲娜姐姐，好可爱～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1013_otokonoko3", "source_sha256": "3921ea8635a1b46c4d6df1e7175bf83016fd54f85e6baebc9080e1472ccc1a8b", "ja": "俺も負けないぞー！　イェーイ！！", "zh": "我也不会输的——！耶——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "dbb0db8258cbbb824183642a0c7688a675943d453b37f010945e98069b62bd30", "ja": "もう少し腰を回転させて……そうそう！\nそうすれば、力強くて素早い正拳突きができるよ！", "zh": "腰再多转动一点……对对！\n这样就能打出有力又迅猛的正拳突击了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1015_otokonoko4", "source_sha256": "a26f673f19e20bf7f0b8b63da541b7d04fe771b6110dfd89aa84860f8b2166cc", "ja": "おーっ、かっけー！！\n僕も空手、うまくなりたい！", "zh": "哦——好帅！！  \n我也想把空手道练得更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1016_onnanoko4", "source_sha256": "7011ac4f903457f1f64780a72e061521ccc8409454864e46d22520a103a54661", "ja": "真お姉ちゃん、弟子にしてくださいっ！", "zh": "真姐姐，请收我为徒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "0fbde45951ed341062d33a7affe10ad9bd50f975f4398862220cfc1b3dd0676b", "ja": "あははっ、みんなやる気満々だね！\nよーし、それじゃあ、次の型をやってみようか！", "zh": "啊哈哈，大家都干劲十足呢！\n好——那我们来试试下一个招式吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1018_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "8c4c937e49f39ecbcbc13ff1a229e2af06f0f1288657767d3ca46ee31be1d21f", "ja": "今日はみなさんに喜んでもらえて、よかったですわ。\nわたくしたちも、とっても楽しかったですわよ。", "zh": "今天能让大家开心，真是太好了。\n我们也玩得非常开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1020_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "7d1495146307e1b6485bc9203a33f8d5817c81958d18a61a1915eafd7c6d5aff", "ja": "うん、すっごく楽しかった！\nアイドルって、すっごくかっこいいね！", "zh": "嗯，特别开心！\n偶像真的特别帅气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1021_onnanoko1", "source_sha256": "89b76916599c6379372c38ce56e4b0e27d2babd27ee404fbd7bbdbc513ac787f", "ja": "ううん、かわいいんだよ！\nダンスだって、とっても上手なんだから！", "zh": "不，真的很可爱呀！\n就连舞蹈也跳得特别好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9c3065ba092d63e8fcfddac94c94fcd5b877fcf7cc4fc3f57bd9c48d65c0ba9f", "ja": "うーん、どっちも正解かな？　かっこいいも可愛いも、\nアイドルの個性で……両方持ってる人もいる。", "zh": "嗯——，或许两边都算正确吧？帅气也好，可爱也好，都是偶像的个性……也有人两种都具备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5e6d0a87fd271c37020f2f07b088c86c89983d1f057c9c2586541957ac38d05f", "ja": "ひとりひとりが違う個性を持っているからこそ、\n大勢の人を楽しませることができるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "正因为每个人都有着不同的个性，才能让那么多人感到快乐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "98db42059a77a250a853585f4fc6490e7d0c7a33eae6d45e992f840b18bc85a1", "ja": "みんなだって、カッコよかったし、かわいかったヨ！\n歌もダンスも上手だったしネ！", "zh": "大家也很帅气，很可爱哦！\n唱歌跳舞也都很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "06f2db870da3085c4066452e701de28ed75b39dc29bce545cb089f7a02ad7ee0", "ja": "うん！　もしかしたら、君たちの中から、\nアイドルになる子がいるかもね！", "zh": "嗯！说不定你们当中，会有人成为偶像呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1026_otokonoko2", "source_sha256": "c023128172d2a117bd98b00c53f451d9e01461b4ff688b04f9b32f7f0b2901a8", "ja": "えー、でも……\n芸能界って、怖いところなんでしょ？", "zh": "呃，可是……\n演艺圈是个很可怕的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1027_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "ed19352aadd49a642b582a0676d9769730bd220af085e6caa29555416ce0bc72", "ja": "私も、聞いたことある。\n悪い大人がいるって……。", "zh": "我也听说过。\n听说有坏大人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "66f93bc9fa26fe191a68fa60066c7de0d09baba9d8d601614083f024be52682c", "ja": "悪い大人……。じーっ。", "zh": "坏大人……盯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "1029a0521f733f1ab6fecadfe0cc50818fb8ee9b28a9724b2ca9017d33dbf6af", "ja": "じーっ。", "zh": "盯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "566935a59343bad5e16b151f7a8ab5d07c5cb7b28b597ec3cdfedff675fc4262", "ja": "ど、どうした、みんな？　俺の方を見て……。", "zh": "怎、怎么了，大家？一直盯着我看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "b9644f618dda0ef289b55cc34f3f6b43584367468cba8035715c48f6f6e576c0", "ja": "{$P$}……そうなノ？", "zh": "{$P$}……是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "83a56e4041e3e04a094768c1c25204522b3c0720ef8fd661a9e0827ab953a845", "ja": "ち、違う！　誤解だ！\nどうしてそんなデマが……。", "zh": "不、不是！这是误会！\n为什么会有这种谣言……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1033_onnanoko3", "source_sha256": "b35c90ff2a87eff343ac8411193ffc1622c9fa8e92ee62087ce223f7ac7ac4f3", "ja": "でも、お姉ちゃんたち、みんな優しかった！\nだからここには、悪い大人はいないと思うな。", "zh": "不过，姐姐们都很温柔！\n所以我觉得这里没有坏大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "5b317b1f276d8fbc3e43e15d1f7d545b3a760406ec3877b7878184b8c09f3a4c", "ja": "ふふっ、そう言ってくれて、うれしいですわ！\nでは最後に……わたくしたちから、プレゼントですわ♪", "zh": "呵呵，你能这么说，我很高兴呢！那么最后……这是我们送给你的礼物♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1035_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "aeaf77fc6dbd20907e841564478718898bc188a25666ce81ee36b872127143e0", "ja": "わーい！", "zh": "耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1036_onnanoko5", "source_sha256": "336f23f904db6fe192e79c80bd470c54a90db33609f33e4529e95d5c708c5d68", "ja": "……はぁ。", "zh": "……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "923ce0bec9b3bb9300d738f0661a978c53a38f32fd4dda3b63ae9dbe8424289c", "ja": "どうかしましたか？\nため息は、幸せが逃げていってしまいます。", "zh": "怎么了？\n叹气的话，幸福可是会溜走的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1038_onnanoko5", "source_sha256": "2ca8f39ebeace318d4e3da2fbbf74ad56eb62d794c82f8272472f59371733331", "ja": "あ……えっと……。", "zh": "啊……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "c869eea0be5ed64fbe49ac0f1fa562210d9f19323c15fa5546b076b0b04bfe31", "ja": "どうしたの？　何か悩みごと？\nよかったら、ボクに話してくれないかな？", "zh": "怎么了？是有什么烦恼吗？\n如果你愿意，可以跟我说说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1040_onnanoko5", "source_sha256": "bbcab9949a995e38e1410760551cb46180bd7b1b0462ff2ec68e5cb29ff20507", "ja": "……あのね。今日、一緒に来るはずだった友達が、\n腕を骨折して、入院しちゃったの。", "zh": "……那个，本来今天应该和我一起来的朋友，手臂骨折住院了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "18edfa46edbe7072be95ca8706c54ad688f9d49c34fb6cf0b5b5ef1efec27abb", "ja": "入院……そういえば今日、1人お休みしてるって。\nたしか顔合わせの時、元気よく挨拶してくれた……。", "zh": "住院……这么说来，听说今天有1人请假了。记得初次见面时，她还精神十足地跟我打过招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1042_onnanoko5", "source_sha256": "6132cd89474d3eb5d27bca3487404333c15c286679c5c1bbd1a7054a75a55c80", "ja": "うん。あの子、真お姉ちゃんのファンなの。\n今日も、すっごく楽しみにしてたんだ……。", "zh": "嗯。那个孩子是真姐姐的粉丝。\n今天也是超级期待的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1043_onnanoko5", "source_sha256": "54087f94ee2251f38ae8ec129136340fb8bd49fd249503fd31137430f4fa1090", "ja": "だから……今日、来られなくて、\nすごく、かわいそうだなって……それで……。", "zh": "所以……今天没能来，觉得……真的好可怜……然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "dadc0304eb6cba3f4171e645b05b63aa23b838c2ec9d1ec59aee81c62be84b72", "ja": "そうでしたか。それで、あなたは\nため息を吐いていたんですね。", "zh": "原来是这样。所以，你刚才一直在叹气啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1045_onnanoko5", "source_sha256": "c77c0918687d5c8946ea09233e0140f0c2cc7ad6922d1e8ddc0bff9294033298", "ja": "うん。あの子が来られないのに、\n私だけすごく楽しくて、いいのかなって……グスッ。", "zh": "嗯。明明那孩子来不了，\n就我一个人这么开心，真的好吗……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1046_006mak", "source_sha256": "daa1f92b9770bf5eaa4f60515e6f647f8a106fca0bf91bf5c220a7b68d557f16", "ja": "……よしっ！　大丈夫、泣かないで！\nボクに任せてよ！", "zh": "……好！没事的，别哭啦！\n包在我身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "45e43f24c21cbe1d7b87fa171f6fe98c1b07ebe16ca8796ff23fd6eaefcb5344", "ja": "菊地さん……？", "zh": "菊地小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "f9a8a18b1327b8c30606b37cbbc1209a580e7e2d2f59878fc363f8b63c7ae2ea", "ja": "（パーティーも、そろそろ終わりかな。\nひとまず、成功してよかった……）", "zh": "（派对也差不多要结束了吧。总之，能顺利成功真是太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "93e8cc5e7d1d54369a0704d2bf376c8dc4b674ffc6e182e2189296eab0784f15", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nちょっといいですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n能占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "fb17f263ae3be948237e71a4a430df903d7a146c78ab6aa6f156a41ba4d5d32c", "ja": "ああ、どうかしたか？", "zh": "啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_04_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "dd96511d68deee67bd34ec91d15d236dd686f4f4628a53eb8c40eb42d591c8a9", "ja": "あの、相談したいことがあって！\n……お願い、聞いてくれませんか！？", "zh": "那个，我有事想跟您商量！\n……能请您、听我说说吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
